## Real-runtime note

Real-runtime testing is not required for this branch if it remains contract-only and does not touch runtime execution, worker behavior, init/reset/shutdown, cancellation boundaries, context creation, or prompt streaming.

If future slices wire these contracts into `runtime.mjs`, `workerBridge.mjs`, capability execution, prompt routing, cancellation, or backend adapters, then real-runtime testing should be reconsidered for merge readiness.

